..!interpreter english translate noabbrev englvar
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : allpstart/FOP.PRJM.PLANNER.SELECTION
.. Date           : 26.04.2013
.. Version        :
.. Author         : alltrotec GmbH / ts
.. Copyright      : (c) 1990 - 2013 alltrotec GmbH
.. Functionality  :
..
.. Interface (arguments and their meaning)
..    uses array argument (arg1)            : filname for selected objects
..    uses array argument (arg2)            : selection
..    uses name argument  (xpname=value)    : no
..
..    Argument     meaning
..    -------------------------------------------------------------------------
..
.. Program flow   :
...Includes       :
..*****************************************************************************
..
.set trans -
..
.type text xtfile
..
..*****************************************************************************
.continue               ? _F|defined(G|arg1) ; _F|defined(G|arg2)
..
.set separator
..
.file -TEMPNAME U|xtfile
.output new 'U|xtfile'
.input DATEI.F
..
.select object 'F|expr(G|arg2)'
.continue SELECT        ?  G|success
(0,0,0)
.continue COPY
..
!SELECT:
'H|id'
.select continue
.continue SELECT        ?  G|success
..
!COPY:
.system 'F|expr("cp " + U|xtfile + " " + G|arg1)' BACKGROUND
..
.continue
